{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 32, :comments ["<b>And the prince of the princes of Levi.</b> For they are three. Also the phrase נשיאי הלוי draws itself and another with it, like לא רבים יחכמו. So too it is: נשיאי פקודת שומרי משמרת הקודש (the princes of the charge of the keepers of the watch of the sanctuary). The meaning: for these three are officers over the guards, who are the Levites."], :book :numbers, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 3, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["On Your Way" "http://mobile.tora.ws/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:16:17.469642804Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}